&lt;p data-src-line=&#34;62&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/posts/moectf2024/usbpcap.png&#34; alt=&#34;usbpcap&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34; class=&#34;md-image&#34; width=&#34;604&#34; height=&#34;74&#34; srcset=&#34;/posts/moectf2024/usbpcap.w480.png 480w, /posts/moectf2024/usbpcap.png 604w&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
